03005,10],[44007032,44007033,9]],"xn":2}},"people":[{"id":"israel_682","name":"Israel","also":"","summary":"One who follows on another’s heels; supplanter, (Gen. 25:26; 27:36; Hos. 12:2-4), the second born of the twin sons of Isaac by Rebekah. He was born probably at Lahai-roi, when his father was fifty-nine and Abraham one hundred and fifty-nine years old.","verses":1009,"father":"Isaac","mother":"Rebekah","v":[1,2,3,6,10,12]},{"id":"canaan_914","name":"Canaan","also":"Canaanites, Canaanite","summary":"The fourth son of Ham (Gen. 10:6). His descendants were under a curse in consequence of the transgression of his father (9:22-27). His eldest son, Zidon, was the father of the Sidonians and Phoenicians.","verses":84,"father":"Ham","mother":"","v":[1,12]},{"id":"joshua_1727","name":"Joshua","also":"Jehoshua, Oshea, Jesus, Jeshua, Hoshea","summary":"Jehovah is his help, or Jehovah the Saviour. The son of Nun, of the tribe of Ephraim, the successor of Moses as the leader of Israel.","verses":189,"father":"Nun","mother":"","v":[2,3,4,7,9,13,14,15]}],"places":[{"id":"jordan_653","name":"Jordan","kind":"Water (River)","lat":33.18645,"lon":35.61916,"summary":"But besides these two historical fountains there is a third, called the Hasbany, which rises in the bottom of a valley at the western base of Hermon, 12 miles north of Tell-el-Kady.","verses":177,"v":[1]},{"id":"gibeath-haaraloth_469","name":"Gibeath-haaraloth","kind":"","lat":31.86378,"lon":35.51855,"summary":"","verses":1,"v":[3]},{"id":"egypt_362","name":"Egypt","kind":"Region (Country)","lat":26.4902,"lon":29.8808,"summary":"The land of the Nile and the pyramids, the oldest kingdom of which we have any record, holds a place of great significance in Scripture.","verses":564,"v":[4,5,6,9]},{"id":"gilgal_476","name":"Gilgal","kind":"City","lat":32.1547,"lon":34.95372,"summary":"From the solemn transaction of the reading of the law in the valley of Shechem between Ebal and Gerizim the Israelites moved forward to Gilgal